                "quality_rating": 1
            },
            {
                "comment": "The lectures are very conceptual and math heavy, no code is shown in class. If you don't have a strong math background you won't understand what's going on. Only a few lectures have relevance to programming assignments. If you go to office hours he can explain much more clearly and send you in the right direction though. He's an ok professor.",
